---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="EEU44C16 / EE5C16: Deep Learning and its Applications - François Pitié" currentSection="teaching">
  <div class="mb-8 pb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#0569B9] dark:text-[#82B4DC] mb-1">
      <a href="/teaching" class="hover:underline">&larr; Back to Teaching Overview</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        EEU44C16 / EE5C16: Deep Learning
      </h1>
      <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#0569B9]/10 text-[#0569B9] dark:text-[#82B4DC] font-semibold">
        Level 9 (10 ECTS)
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
      Senior Sophister Engineering & Master in Engineering (MAI), Department of Electronic & Electrical Engineering, Trinity College Dublin.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- External Hub Quick Link Banner -->
  <div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#0569B9]/10 dark:bg-[#0569B9]/20 border border-[#0569B9]/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Looking for the Live Student Course Hub?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Access current schedules, lab assignment releases, Colab notebooks, and announcements.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a 
      href="https://frcs.github.io/4c16/" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded bg-[#0569B9] text-white hover:bg-[#045293] transition-colors text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold shrink-0"
    >
      Open 4C16 Course Hub &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Course Overview -->
  <section class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
      Module Overview
    </h2>
    <p>
      <strong>EEU44C16 / EE5C16</strong> is an intensive graduate-level introduction to deep learning algorithms and their practical applications in signal processing, audio, computer vision, and NLP. The module emphasizes first-principles derivations alongside high-performance PyTorch implementation and distributed GPU training.
    </p>
    <p>
      Topics include multi-layer perceptrons, backpropagation dynamics, regularization (BatchNorm, LayerNorm, Dropout), convolutional architectures (ResNet, ConvNeXt), sequence models (RNNs, LSTMs), attention mechanisms, Transformer architectures, generative adversarial networks (GANs), and diffusion models.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Resources: Notes & Autograder -->
  <section class="space-y-4 mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white pb-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
      Open Courseware & Lab Infrastructure
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Lecture Notes Card -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-200/60 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-300/80 dark:border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-[#0569B9] dark:text-[#82B4DC]">
            <!-- Book Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
            </svg>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4C16 Open Lecture Notes</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Full online textbook authored by François Pitié covering mathematical formulations, architectural diagrams, loss landscapes, and pedagogical tutorials.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-300/60 dark:border-slate-700/60 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0569B9] dark:text-[#82B4DC]">
          <a href="https://frcs.github.io/4C16-LectureNotes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">
            Online Book &rarr;
          </a>
          <span>&bull;</span>
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17954655" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">
            Zenodo Archive (DOI) &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Lab Autograder Card -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-slate-200/60 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-300/80 dark:border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            <!-- Code / Terminal Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Continuous Lab Autograder</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Automated verification framework running against GitHub Classroom. Students build neural models on GPU Colabs and receive instantaneous test evaluation upon git push.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-300/60 dark:border-slate-700/60 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold text-[#0569B9] dark:text-[#82B4DC]">
          <a href="https://github.com/frcs/4C16-2425" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">
            Repository (4C16-2425) &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Teaching Recognition -->
  <section class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <div class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <span class="text-amber-500">★</span> Recognition
    </div>
    <p>
      The design and delivery of the 4C16 automated lab platform and open curriculum was recognized with the <strong>University Excellence in Teaching Award</strong> and the <strong>Inspiring Educator Award</strong> at Trinity College Dublin (2026).
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
